    {
      "id": "frag-4",
      "focal_uid": 4,
      "title": "The quiet margin machine",
      "insight": "Advertising is where two other stories cash out: AI makes the targeting sharper, and Prime supplies the audience and the purchase data. It lands on both the share price and retail profitability, because ad dollars arrive at far higher margin than anything shipped in a box. For a question about the PEAK price, this is the driver most likely to deliver an upside surprise the market has not already paid for.",
