    {
      "id": "frag-1",
      "focal_uid": 1,
      "title": "The engine the whole valuation runs on",
      "insight": "AWS growth is fed by generative-AI demand and by holding cloud share, and it pushes straight onto the price and onto AWS's own margins. Every model in the ensemble ranks it at or near the top. If the peak print over the next three years is going to be a big one, the models are near-unanimous that this is the number that gets it there.",
