    {
      "id": "frag-9",
      "focal_uid": 9,
      "title": "The tail risk that caps the top",
      "insight": "Antitrust is a true root cause on this map - very little feeds into it, but it reaches into cloud share and retail margin alike. Note the ensemble is split on how to even frame it: some models read the extreme end as a court-ordered breakup, others as the suits being dismissed. That disagreement is real signal, and it is the main thing standing between this forecast and its upper bins.",
