    {
      "id": "frag-5",
      "focal_uid": 5,
      "title": "From capex to actual revenue",
      "insight": "This is the hinge where AI spending turns into money. Capital expenditure and the regulatory climate flow in; AWS growth and cloud share flow out. The models treat it as the conversion step rather than a story of its own - if the spending happens but this does not follow, the whole upside case stalls.",
