    {
      "id": "frag-16",
      "focal_uid": 16,
      "title": "Where the money ends up",
      "insight": "Free cash flow and buybacks are the end of the chain: the AI build-out consumes cash and regulation can threaten it, and what survives lands on the share price. It is a sink - nothing downstream of it - so it does not drive the story so much as record the result. Worth watching because heavy capex and a record buyback pull the peak price in opposite directions.",
